WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:19.120
The first day of this Satipatthana course is over.

00:19.120 --> 00:34.360
And the technique remains the same, your practice remains the same.

00:34.360 --> 00:49.920
But the course is a special course in the sense that you will try to understand the

00:49.920 --> 00:59.960
words of the enlightened one, the Buddha.

